PURCHASE AND SALE AGREEMENT

Date: {{date}}

Seller: {{seller_name}}
Buyer: {{buyer_name}} (or assigns)

Property Address: {{property_address}}

Purchase Price: ${{purchase_price}}

Earnest Money Deposit: ${{earnest_money}} to be held by {{title_company}}

Inspection Period: {{inspection_days}} days from acceptance

Closing Date: On or before {{closing_date}}

ASSIGNABILITY:
Buyer may assign this Agreement without further consent from Seller.

CONDITION OF PROPERTY:
Property is sold AS-IS. Seller makes no warranties or guarantees.

ACCESS:
Buyer and/or assigns shall have reasonable access to the property for inspection.

DEFAULT:
If Buyer defaults, earnest money may be forfeited.
If Seller defaults, Buyer may pursue legal remedies.

ADDITIONAL TERMS:
{{additional_terms}}

